WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.676
Here's what happens when you add a client, from start to finish.

2
00:00:04.076 --> 00:00:06.632
Enter their name, email and phone number.

3
00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:11.121
The email matters most, because that's where their activation code goes.

4
00:00:11.546 --> 00:00:15.474
You can set up their activities now, or skip this and do it later.

5
00:00:15.941 --> 00:00:21.406
They'll show as awaiting activation until they join, and you can send them a reminder from right here.

6
00:00:21.831 --> 00:00:26.715
Meanwhile, they get an email from you, with their code and a link to download the app.

7
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:32.128
They open the app, tap Create account, and enter their email and that code.

8
00:00:32.545 --> 00:00:37.304
Then they check their details, choose a password, and accept the privacy policy.

9
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.463
And that's it, they're in.

10
00:00:40.859 --> 00:00:44.964
Back in your portal, they now show up as an active client.

11
00:00:44.964 --> 00:00:48.856
Their activities, check-ins and messages all land here.

12
00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:52.101
Whenever you're ready, add your first client.

